 },
 "notes": "All four files: 1920x1080, 24000/1001 native (no frame padding), yuv420p, h264_videotoolbox 25M, AAC 48k. No channel logos found by temporal-median edge masks, so no removelogo was needed; no burned subtitles in hokage_1-3. Shot lists are automatic (HSV-histogram cuts cross-checked with ffmpeg scene 0.25/0.35); fast fight sections are over-split by flash frames. sharp_auto uses Laplacian variance on the content area (>=250 sharp, >=100 ok); glow/flash/flat-colour shots read low even when the line art is crisp, so the curated 'sharp' field in moments is from reading frames."
